mes per team  uh i i look you know the nfl has come  too far  and done too many things  to try to make this season happen  i will be extremely surprised if there  are these  pockets of outbreaks that force the nfl  to cancel let's say  seven weeks per team  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports
 

